ata-end=&quot;1985&quot;&gt;➡️ CPU hiện đại đoán cực tốt (~95%+)&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1987&quot; data-end=&quot;1990&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1992&quot; data-end=&quot;2022&quot;&gt;❌ Misprediction (đoán sai)&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2024&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;👉 Phải &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2032&quot; data-end=&quot;2050&quot;&gt;flush pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2052&quot; data-end=&quot;2070&quot;&gt;➡️ Mất nhiều cycle&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2072&quot; data-end=&quot;2075&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2077&quot; data-end=&quot;2107&quot;&gt;✅ 3. Speculative Execution&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2109&quot; data-end=&quot;2157&quot;&gt;👉 Chạy trước theo dự đoán&lt;br data-start=&quot;2135&quot; data-end=&quot;2138&quot;&gt;&#xa;👉 Sai thì rollback&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2159&quot; data-end=&quot;2162&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2164&quot; data-end=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;🧱 3. Structural Hazard – “Thiếu tài nguyên”&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]&quot; aria-label=&quot;Open image details for #computer architecture#如何设计一个处理器3 - 倒头呼呼 - 博客园&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/_8kJWtWGETxZos40wlb_AmDFX2ILSXw_CRzyEdqlFG0tzw_-Vt9QXIi6AYVBYGv4Y-4wtmA0vK-ncwMdqC_tCc4bl5og9NssT5RqVdTPPyucdLMznCjQ0uo0Ln6JK30sF004aJzW-2zcYnf_zf3pa1Rij_2n3TuscvfJAr969ty6a2TN-SOm4JcI0wjRCyVC?pu