0&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-xs font-semibold&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;961&quot;&gt;💡 Định nghĩa&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;962&quot; data-end=&quot;991&quot;&gt;MMU = phần cứng trong CPU&lt;/strong&gt; dùng để:&lt;br&gt;&#xa;👉 Chuyển &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1011&quot; data-end=&quot;1049&quot;&gt;virtual address → physical address&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1051&quot; data-end=&quot;1054&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1056&quot; data-end=&quot;1078&quot;&gt;🔄 Luồng hoạt động&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1080&quot; data-end=&quot;1104&quot;&gt;Khi CPU truy cập memory:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1106&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;&#xa;CPU tạo &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1117&quot; data-end=&quot;1136&quot;&gt;virtual address&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1137&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;&#xa;MMU tra &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1162&quot;&gt;page table&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;&#xa;Nếu có:&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1177&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;&#xa;→ chuyển sang &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1213&quot;&gt;physical address&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1214&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;&#xa;Nếu không:&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1231&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1231&quot; data-end=&quot;1267&quot;&gt;&#xa;→ xảy ra &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1256&quot;&gt;page fault&lt;/strong&gt; → OS xử lý&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1269&quot; data-end=&quot;1272&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;1274&quot; data-end=&quot;1311&quot;&gt;🧱 3. Paging – cơ chế phổ biến nhất&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1327&quot;&gt;💡 Ý tưởng&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1373&quot;&gt;&#xa;Chia memory thành các &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1352&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;page&lt;/strong&gt; (thường 4KB)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1374&quot; data-end=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;&#xa;Virtual memory và physical memory đều chia page&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1425&quot; data-end=&quot;1428&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1430&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;🔄 Mapping&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1446&quot; data-end=&quot;1525&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Virtual page 0 → Physical frame 5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Virtual page 1 → Physical frame 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1527&quot; data-end=&quot;1564&quot;&gt;👉 Không cần liên tục → rất linh hoạt&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;1571&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;⚡ 4. Page Table (Bảng trang)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1603&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;Page table lưu:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1649&quot;&gt;&#xa;mapping (virtual → physical)&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1650&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;&#xa;quyền truy cập:&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1670&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;&#xa;Read / Write / Execute&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;&#xa;trạng thái:&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;&#xa;valid / invalid&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1730&quot; data-end=&quot;1733&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;1735&quot; data-end=&quot;1752&quot;&gt;📌 Vấn đề lớn&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1753&quot; data-end=&quot;1778&quot;&gt;👉 Page table rất to 😬&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1780&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;→ Giải pháp:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;&#xa;Multi-level page table&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;1818&quot; data-end=&quot;1823&quot;&gt;&#xa;TLB&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1825&quot; data-end=&quot;1828&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;1830&quot; data-end=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;🚀 5. TLB (Translation Lookaside Buffer)&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-s-xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;group/search-image @container/search-image relative rounded-[inherit] h-full w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[inherit]&quot; aria-label=&quot;Open image details for The 16KB Question: Why Android’s Big Memory Change Matters and How to Prepare Your App - droidcon&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/0uT-bjXi2Mt3-QeBo-IfOdtpM2yiUWczrf2Yb5-QUu57rZPQEQYbkGcxHpQ8o8RMokDtP8h64H_RGzXEXjuAyYTN52NyGLZyvt_HgGtJp8AY6qAl33qEd_O8xiM0gYEeOj3hKHdGZ-Qbc9Wb85CAx3Ky011wIUiIxt7ITWhelnBUJND789TfU_AzyhQKkKje?purpose=fullsize&quot; class=&quot;bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover&quot; src=&quot;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/MFJ_11e3BpYPDDRZZAr5liM8IUVLy14pD38qny1VjqYrkcd2mCvMOhGiu6yd0wACthquJoGyTTUqRKBKrAWJ_fXklEA5u2o7h2ssdzR6apbfjWfpapiXuAarDeWlG_xzlmre-PBF3aT9Frwo9ZtDkZJhJgU8tHMFTW_jBRqEWWQ?purpose=inline&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&