nd AHB)&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/bJfwJyoziDwhX4DPkeNA3hjyk_1kPDfZctyDDiOc_BZQxDs7ukJ8Z5A1tRCBnVCYgSiXM6xjLvf_IlxtfdzN-FkVGno68MFazyJKYyu5if88CgqTxSimNA2QvvYMooMGRb0a1EvPBfJGxwDRH4vrK2ao4P8k3z5bvY9LruDYCXbFJd5kvQwILH35wDZFmd7o?purpose=fullsize&quot; class=&quot;bg-token-main-surface-tertiary m-0 h-full w-full object-cover&quot; src=&quot;https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-4/0cQ1b5HEnN66cG4P5hk7xEUCyU4zuWM2M9sq7tgauOfwpSLSmBvTlcRDDY5rBl4lsJjrciwiIdpK8JvR6mr1Pg1QEhsfQUFX55tLz3NZac3lAJd6pbgU_nT8ZJ_uGCLwMs3k4LIvSHVrejXPZGA0b3GC82XkK6xe1HftQ0v6qTI?purpose=inline&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-10 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;shrink-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75&quot;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-xs font-semibold&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;317&quot; data-end=&quot;340&quot;&gt;💡 Có 3 loại chính:&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;540&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;343&quot; data-end=&quot;382&quot;&gt;AXI (Advanced eXtensible Interface)&lt;/strong&gt; → mạnh nhất, dùng cho hiệu năng cao&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;462&quot;&gt;AHB (Advanced High-performance Bus)&lt;/strong&gt; → trung gian&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;540&qu