&quot;2074&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Out-of-order&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;2074&quot; data-end=&quot;2079&quot;&gt;Có&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2088&quot;&gt;Không&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;2089&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;2089&quot; data-end=&quot;2097&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Burst&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;2097&quot; data-end=&quot;2104&quot;&gt;Mạnh&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;2104&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;Có nhưng hạn chế&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;2125&quot; data-end=&quot;2136&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Use case&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;2136&quot; data-end=&quot;2153&quot;&gt;SoC, AI, Linux&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;2153&quot; data-end=&quot;2166&quot;&gt;MCU, RTOS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2168&quot; data-end=&quot;2171&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2173&quot; data-end=&quot;2221&quot;&gt;🔗 5. Liên hệ thực tế (cực quan trọng với bạn)&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2223&quot; data-end=&quot;2255&quot;&gt;🧠 Trong SoC chạy Linux + AI&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2257&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2257&quot; data-end=&quot;2270&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;CPU → AXI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2271&quot; data-end=&quot;2284&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;DMA → AXI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2285&quot; data-end=&quot;2302&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;NPU/GPU → AXI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2304&quot; data-end=&quot;2353&quot;&gt;👉 Tất cả cùng tranh bus → cần AXI để không nghẽn&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2355&quot; data-end=&quot;2358&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2360&quot; data-end=&quot;2383&quot;&gt;⚙️ Ví dụ thực chiến&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2385&quot; data-end=&quot;2402&quot;&gt;👉 Khi chạy YOLO:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;2404&quot; data-end=&quot;2486&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2404&quot; data-end=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;DMA đọc ảnh từ RAM qua AXI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2436&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;NPU đọc tensor qua AXI&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2464&quot; data-end=&quot;2486&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;CPU xử lý control&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2488&quot; data-end=&quot;2532&quot;&gt;➡️ Nếu bus yếu → &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2505&quot; data-end=&quot;2532&quot;&gt;bottleneck ngay lập tức&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2534&quot; data-end=&quot;2537&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2539&quot; data-end=&quot;2560&quot;&gt;💣 Bug bạn sẽ gặp&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;2562&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2562&quot; data-end=&quot;2621&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2565&quot; data-end=&quot;2583&quot;&gt;Bus contention&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2587&quot; data-end=&quot;2621&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2587&quot; data-end=&quot;2621&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;nhiều master tranh nhau → chậm&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2682&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2626&quot; data-end=&quot;2649&quot;&gt;Throughput không đủ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2653&quot; data-end=&quot;2682&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2653&quot; data-end=&quot;2682&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AI model bị “starve data”&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2684&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2687&quot; data-end=&quot;2702&quot;&gt;Latency cao&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2706&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2706&quot; data-end=&quot;2738&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;do thiết kế interconnect kém&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2740&quot; data-end=&quot;2743&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;2745&quot; data-end=&quot;2768&quot;&gt;🎯 Tóm tắt cực dễ nhớ&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2770&quot; data-end=&quot;2903&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2770&quot; data-end=&quot;2813&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2772&quot; data-end=&quot;2813&quot;&gt;AXI = mạnh, phức tạp, dùng cho hệ lớn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2814&quot; data-end=&quot;2851&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2816&quot; data-end=&quot;2851&quot;&gt;AHB = đơn giản, dễ dùng, hệ nhỏ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;2852&quot; data-end=&quot;2903&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;AXI tách kênh + song song → nhanh hơn rất nhiều&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" link="&#xa;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;53&quot;&gt;🧠 Bus trong kiến trúc máy tính (AMBA) — AXI &amp;amp; AHB&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;55&quot; data-end=&quot;240&quot;&gt;Khi bạn làm Embedded/SoC (đặc biệt Edge AI), &lt;strong data-start=&quot;100&quot; data-end=&quot;107&quot;&gt;bus&lt;/strong&gt; là “mạch máu” nối CPU, RAM, DMA, GPU/NPU lại với nhau. Phổ biến nhất là họ chuẩn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;189&quot; data-end=&quot;197&quot;&gt;AMBA&lt;/strong&gt; của &lt;span class=&quot;ho