absolute inset-x-2 bottom-2 z-10 flex max-w-[calc(100%-1rem)] flex-wrap items-end justify-end gap-1.5&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;shrink-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75&quot;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;h-4 w-4&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-xs font-semibold&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;317&quot; data-end=&quot;340&quot;&gt;💡 Có 3 loại chính:&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;ul data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;540&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;341&quot; data-end=&quot;420&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;343&quot; data-end=&quot;382&quot;&gt;AXI (Advanced eXtensible Interface)&lt;/strong&gt; → mạnh nhất, dùng cho hiệu năng cao&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;421&quot; data-end=&quot;477&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;423&quot; data-end=&quot;462&quot;&gt;AHB (Advanced High-performance Bus)&lt;/strong&gt; → trung gian&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;li data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;540&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;480&quot; data-end=&quot;513&quot;&gt;APB (Advanced Peripheral Bus)&lt;/strong&gt; → đơn giản, cho ngoại vi&#xa;&lt;/li&gt;&#xa;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;542&quot; data-end=&quot;599&quot;&gt;👉 Bạn hỏi AXI &amp;amp; AHB → đây là 2 loại “xương sống” của SoC&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;604&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;606&quot; data-end=&quot;647&quot;&gt;🚀 2. AXI – Bus hiện đại, hiệu năng cao&lt;/h1&gt;&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 not-first:mt-4&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overf